In addition to the statistical significance, it is always helpful to calculate a measure of effect size to get a sense of the practical significance of the effect. What is the Cohen’s d for this effect? How should we interpret this value? As a reminder, the formula for calculate Cohen’s d is:
\[
d=\dfrac{X-\mu}{\sigma}
\]
